## Purpose

The FreeLawGen React Native app is published for **regular people defending
themselves in court** (self-represented / pro se litigants) and for **States**
building their own court systems. It is NOT intended for attorneys to
commercialize. This license keeps the tool free and open for those purposes
while preventing third parties from profiting off derivative works without a
separate paid license.

